  "description": "Fuaran declared token contract — a DTCG-compatible theme manifest extended with the two things DTCG lacks: a per-token role → ToneVariant mapping and a soft-weighted invariant block (contrast floors, colour-usage budgets, motion voice). The machine-readable contract an AI reasons against and the StyleObserver verifies against. FSharp.Core-only + Fable-portable (no Browser/renderer dep). Apache-2.0 licensed.",
